        narrative: "Climb the rock first thing — 1,200 steps, the frescoes and the mirror wall on the way up, and a fifth-century palace footprint on top. Down by 10am, then the drive south to Kandy with the afternoon free. Time your arrival for the 6.30pm puja at the Temple of the Tooth, which is the one time of day the relic chamber opens.",
        tours: ["/sri-lanka/colombo/sigiriya-sunrise-climb-dambulla-cave-temples-colombo", "/sri-lanka/colombo/kandy-pinnawala-royal-botanic-gardens-day-trip-colombo", "/sri-lanka/colombo/kandy-peradeniya-gardens-tea-factory-day-tour-colombo"],
