    quickAnswer: "Eight days is the seven-day Sri Lanka loop with a real beach day rather than a rushed last morning. Day 1 Colombo, day 2 Sigiriya, day 3 the rock at dawn then Kandy, day 4 tea country and the hill train, day 5 Ella, day 6 an Udawalawe safari down to the coast, day 7 Mirissa for whales and the beach, day 8 Galle Fort and the drive to the airport.",
